\ Fixtures for module-deps template invalidation. Each word here runs through a cloned
\ deps-and-words frame, so a sibling call resolves against that frame.

\ report calls helper via late binding through the module-deps frame.
helper: ( -- s ) [ "module-helper" ] ;
report: ( -- s ) [ helper ] ;

\ compute calls a sibling dependency, exercising the cloned frame plus arithmetic.
add-ten: ( n -- n ) [ 10 + ] ;
compute: ( n -- n ) [ add-ten ] ;
